<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\春の兆し.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田夕食.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Ahahahaa! <STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE>, you really do eat a lot, don't you!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Chomp!</STYLE>
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">　Chomp!</STYLE>
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">　Chomp!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Well, I'm just glad she seems to like Arata's cooking."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, </STYLE>Sis<STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What is it? My <STYLE ID="3">cute little sister</STYLE>!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Sis<STYLE ID="3"> or </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, which one's the bigger eater?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what are you saying? What do you think happens when </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> gets serious?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Chomp!</STYLE>
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">　Chomp!</STYLE>
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">　Chomp!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE>Sis<STYLE ID="3">'s a really big eater too. Right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's just that I can eat as much as I like if I put my mind to it. 
{PAUSE ""}
Normally I stop at one regular portion, and drinking like this is more fun than eating a lot!
{PAUSE ""}
　Oh, <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>, another one on the rocks."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh, so </STYLE>Chiga-nee<STYLE ID="2"> can eat that much too? Then how about five bowls of curry?"</STYLE><PG>
"Five bowls?
{PAUSE ""}
　That wouldn't take me 10 minutes."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh!? You don't mean whether you could finish them, you mean you'd be done eating in 10 minutes!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Chomp!</STYLE>
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">　Chomp!</STYLE>
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">　Chomp!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"See, I told you </STYLE>Sis<STYLE ID="3">'s amazing... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Even when I say, 'Why not enter an eating contest?' she never really seems into it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"If I did something like that, the gentlemen would be put off, you know!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Your drinking already puts them off plenty..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Chomp!</STYLE>
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">　Chomp!</STYLE>
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">　Chomp!</STYLE>
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! Seconds!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's already your seventh bowl of rice..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hmmm. From what I can see, I still think </STYLE>Sis<STYLE ID="3">'s stronger."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Here you go, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, seconds."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Thank you!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Chomp!</STYLE>
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">　Chomp!</STYLE>
{WAIT "200" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="1">　Chomp!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, did you see that eating contest on TV the other day? How far do you think </STYLE>Chiga-nee<STYLE ID="2"> could go in that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh, I saw it, I saw it!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　But... the champion, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="みなみざき">Minamizaki</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">-something-san, was it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　</STYLE>Sis<STYLE ID="3"> makes her look totally lame."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No way... </STYLE>Chiga-nee<STYLE ID="2">'s national level, huh..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Whew, my stomach's settled down a little!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　If I remember right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="みなみざき">Minamizaki</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">-something-san was in today's Motoki-cho Eating Contest, you know? As a special guest or something."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, that's the contest you enter every year, right? Well, even </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> might have been at a disadvantage against a national champion..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's right. I just like eating a lot, and the contests are only for fun. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">A serious showdown like that would be a bit much..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"So that means, compared to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, </STYLE>Chiga-nee<STYLE ID="2"> can eat even more...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ahhahahaha! As long as you enjoy your food, that's all that matters, isn't it!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Exactly! Quality over quantity!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> just said you like eating a lot..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hmmm. </STYLE>Sis<STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... I wonder if the day will ever come when the two of them face off..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you still alive?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Huh?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Ahaha, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I'm so happy!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">She</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s way too blissed out over the Arata food..."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
